But since you said you want to do it manually, you can just create a method in your domain object that returns the DTO, or a static method that takes the domain object and returns the DTO.
For example:
public class User {
    private String name;
    private int age;

    // getters and setters

    public UserDTO toDTO() {
        UserDTO dto = new UserDTO();
        dto.setName(this.name);
        dto.setAge(this.age);
        return dto;
    }
}
Or a static method:
public class UserDTOConverter {
    public static UserDTO toDTO(User user) {
        UserDTO dto = new UserDTO();
        dto.setName(user.getName());
        dto.setAge(user.getAge());
        return dto;
    }
}
